      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 13a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"/><rect x="3" y="13" width="4" height="6" rx="1.6"/><rect x="17" y="13" width="4" height="6" rx="1.6"/><path d="M20 17.5V19a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-4"/></svg>
      外卖代下单</a>
